 "remarks": "Huge is the word for this completely renovated Glenbrook rental. The main level is one massive, sun-filled great room - a wide-open stretch of living, dining, and kitchen that runs the full depth of the home, anchored by a stone-accent fireplace wall on one end and a showpiece maple kitchen on the other. The island alone seats a crowd, with a quartz counter that goes on forever, gas cooktop, double wall ovens, and stainless appliances. French doors pour light across gleaming hardwood floors with room for every layout you can imagine. Fresh, bright bedrooms with new carpet and ceiling fans, plus a finished upper level ideal for a primary suite, office, or media room. Sparkling new baths include a glass-door tiled shower and a classic tub bath. In-unit washer/dryer, walk-in closet with organizers, and a huge private roof deck with privacy screen. Up to 4 off-street parking spaces - garage parking available for extra (negotiable) - all steps from Glenbrook train, a direct line into Manhattan. Space like this rarely comes available.",
